    {
      "name": "Corrupting Spite",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "void"
      ],
      "description": "<p>When the wight deals damage to a living creature with its claw or dagger Strike, the wight regains 2 void plus healing Hit Points and the target must succeed at a DC 17 Fortitude save or take 2 damage that can't be healed. The wight can use corrupting spite multiple times, but a single creature can't take more than 8 unhealable damage.</p>\n<p>Each full night of rest heals 2 of the unhealable damage, and a full day of bed rest increases the recovery to 4 of the unhealable damage.</p>",
